  "isoDate": "2025-10-28T05:33:27.871Z",
  "content": "<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=utf-8\"><title>Make Your App China-Ready: How to Deploy Web Services Inside the Great Chinese Firewall</title><style>\n      * {\n        font-family: Georgia, Cambria, \"Times New Roman\", Times, serif;\n      }\n      html, body {\n        margin: 0;\n        padding: 0;\n      }\n      h1 {\n        font-size: 50px;\n        margin-bottom: 17px;\n        color: #333;\n      }\n      h2 {\n        font-size: 24px;\n        line-height: 1.6;\n        margin: 30px 0 0 0;\n        margin-bottom: 18px;\n        margin-top: 33px;\n        color: #333;\n      }\n      h3 {\n        font-size: 30px;\n        margin: 10px 0 20px 0;\n        color: #333;\n      }\n      header {\n        width: 640px;\n        margin: auto;\n      }\n      section {\n        width: 640px;\n        margin: auto;\n      }\n      section p {\n        margin-bottom: 27px;\n        font-size: 20px;\n        line-height: 1.6;\n        color: #333;\n      }\n      section img {\n        max-width: 640px;\n      }\n      footer {\n        padding: 0 20px;\n        margin: 50px 0;\n        text-align: center;\n        font-size: 12px;\n      }\n      .aspectRatioPlaceholder {\n        max-width: auto !important;\n        max-height: auto !important;\n      }\n      .aspectRatioPlaceholder-fill {\n        padding-bottom: 0 !important;\n      }\n      header,\n      section[data-field=subtitle],\n      section[data-field=description] {\n        display: none;\n      }\n      </style></head><body><article class=\"h-entry\">\n<header>\n<h1 class=\"p-name\">Make Your App China-Ready: How to Deploy Web Services Inside the Great Chinese Firewall</h1>\n</header>\n<section data-field=\"subtitle\" class=\"p-summary\">\nDiscover how to deploy web services in China’s internet environment. Learn cloud-native strategies with Alibaba Cloud &amp; the Great Firewall\n</section>\n<section data-field=\"body\" class=\"e-content\">\n<section name=\"7d5a\" class=\"section section--body section--first\"><div class=\"section-divider\"><hr class=\"section-divider\"></div><div class=\"section-content\"><div class=\"section-inner sectionLayout--insetColumn\"><h3 name=\"9f2e\" id=\"9f2e\" class=\"graf graf--h3 graf--leading graf--title\">Make Your App China-Ready: How to Deploy Web Services Inside the Great Chinese Firewall</h3><h3 name=\"fca4\" id=\"fca4\" class=\"graf graf--h3 graf-after--h3\">Meta Description</h3><blockquote name=\"668d\" id=\"668d\" class=\"graf graf--blockquote graf-after--h3 graf--trailing\"><em class=\"markup--em markup--blockquote-em\">Discover how to deploy web services in China’s unique internet environment. Learn cloud-native strategies with Alibaba Cloud, Tencent Cloud &amp; the Great Firewall.</em></blockquote></div></div></section><section name=\"b2d5\" class=\"section section--body\"><div class=\"section-divider\"><hr class=\"section-divider\"></div><div class=\"section-content\"><div class=\"section-inner sectionLayout--insetColumn\"><h3 name=\"ad0a\" id=\"ad0a\" class=\"graf graf--h3 graf--leading\">Introduction</h3><p name=\"9417\" id=\"9417\" class=\"graf graf--p graf-after--h3\">If your web app works beautifully everywhere, except Mainland China, you’re not alone.</p><p name=\"b257\" id=\"b257\" class=\"graf graf--p graf-after--p\">For developers, deploying inside the <strong class=\"markup--strong markup--p-strong\">Great Firewall</strong> can feel like a mix of mystery and dark magic: some services time out, some APIs vanish, and CDNs that used to fly now crawl.</p><p name=\"dce4\" id=\"dce4\" class=\"graf graf--p graf-after--p\">In this guide, we’ll go beyond translation and show you what it really takes to <strong class=\"markup--strong markup--p-strong\">make your app China-ready</strong> - from cultural context to cloud deployment on <strong class=\"markup--strong markup--p-strong\">Alibaba Cloud</strong>, <strong class=\"markup--strong markup--p-strong\">Tencent Cloud</strong>, or <strong class=\"markup--strong markup--p-strong\">Huawei Cloud</strong>.</p><p name=\"fa55\" id=\"fa55\" class=\"graf graf--p graf-after--p graf--trailing\">Whether you’re a startup expanding east or a seasoned engineer curious about <strong class=\"markup--strong markup--p-strong\">how to deploy web services in China</strong>, this walkthrough will give you a clear path through the wall — the legal way.</p></div></div></section><section name=\"d589\" class=\"section section--body\"><div class=\"section-divider\"><hr class=\"section-divider\"></div><div class=\"section-content\"><div class=\"section-inner sectionLayout--insetColumn\"><h3 name=\"cb26\" id=\"cb26\" class=\"graf graf--h3 graf--leading\">1. Why China’s Internet Is Different</h3><p name=\"5164\" id=\"5164\" class=\"graf graf--p graf-after--h3\">China’s internet evolved on its own track. Adoption lagged the West by nearly a decade, and by the time mass users came online, smartphones were already everywhere.</p><figure name=\"a5ac\" id=\"a5ac\" class=\"graf graf--figure graf-after--p\"><img class=\"graf-image\" data-image-id=\"1*4cXfk3FQB29ysC_v5SPfuQ.png\" data-width=\"3400\" data-height=\"2765\" src=\"https://cdn-images-1.medium.com/max/800/1*4cXfk3FQB29ysC_v5SPfuQ.png\"><figcaption class=\"imageCaption\">China adopted internet almost a decade after the West</figcaption></figure><p name=\"6fba\" id=\"6fba\" class=\"graf graf--p graf-after--figure\">That meant <strong class=\"markup--strong markup--p-strong\">China skipped the desktop era entirely</strong> — it went mobile-first head-on.</p><p name=\"7f8e\" id=\"7f8e\" class=\"graf graf--p graf-after--p graf--trailing\">As a result, the ecosystem built around the mobile web: <em class=\"markup--em markup--p-em\">super-apps</em>, mini-programs, dense UI design, and seamless mobile payments. Combine that with data localization rules and firewall routing, and you get a <strong class=\"markup--strong markup--p-strong\">parallel internet infrastructure</strong>.</p></div></div></section><section name=\"93fc\" class=\"section section--body\"><div class=\"section-divider\"><hr class=\"section-divider\"></div><div class=\"section-content\"><div class=\"section-inner sectionLayout--insetColumn\"><h3 name=\"7e1c\" id=\"7e1c\" class=\"graf graf--h3 graf--leading\">2. The Great Firewall and Its Impact</h3><p name=\"ec06\" id=\"ec06\" class=\"graf graf--p graf-after--h3\">The <strong class=\"markup--strong markup--p-strong\">Great Chinese Firewall</strong> isn’t just censorship — it’s a complex network layer that filters, inspects, and shapes traffic flow.</p><p name=\"9ca7\" id=\"9ca7\" class=\"graf graf--p graf-after--p\">From a developer’s perspective, here’s what it means:</p><ul class=\"postList\"><li name=\"8a23\" id=\"8a23\" class=\"graf graf--li graf-after--p\">Cross-border traffic latency can increase by hundreds of milliseconds.</li><li name=\"a0c5\" id=\"a0c5\" class=\"graf graf--li graf-after--li\">Many third-party resources (Google APIs, YouTube, fonts, Firebase) are inaccessible.</li><li name=\"0417\" id=\"0417\" class=\"graf graf--li graf-after--li\">Global CDNs underperform or get throttled.</li></ul><p name=\"f214\" id=\"f214\" class=\"graf graf--p graf-after--li graf--trailing\">In other words, your global cloud architecture isn’t broken — it’s just <em class=\"markup--em markup--p-em\">not optimized for the Chinese internet topology.</em></p></div></div></section><section name=\"7125\" class=\"section section--body\"><div class=\"section-divider\"><hr class=\"section-divider\"></div><div class=\"section-content\"><div class=\"section-inner sectionLayout--insetColumn\"><h3 name=\"a450\" id=\"a450\" class=\"graf graf--h3 graf--leading\">3. Cultural &amp; UX Differences That Matter</h3></div><div class=\"section-inner sectionLayout--outsetRow\" data-paragraph-count=\"2\"><figure name=\"980c\" id=\"980c\" class=\"graf graf--figure graf--layoutOutsetRow is-partialWidth graf-after--h3\" style=\"width: 54.158%;\"><img class=\"graf-image\" data-image-id=\"1*_7HP_g_rLhFRXsYllAvzyg.png\" data-width=\"828\" data-height=\"1550\" src=\"https://cdn-images-1.medium.com/max/800/1*_7HP_g_rLhFRXsYllAvzyg.png\"></figure><figure name=\"4f99\" id=\"4f99\" class=\"graf graf--figure graf--layoutOutsetRowContinue is-partialWidth graf-after--figure\" style=\"width: 45.842%;\"><img class=\"graf-image\" data-image-id=\"1*YipE7qDNVVhlJq-54O9FEw.png\" data-width=\"672\" data-height=\"1488\" src=\"https://cdn-images-1.medium.com/max/600/1*YipE7qDNVVhlJq-54O9FEw.png\"><figcaption class=\"imageCaption\" style=\"width: 218.141%; left: -118.141%;\">Taobao vs Amazon — mobile version</figcaption></figure></div><div class=\"section-inner sectionLayout--outsetRow\" data-paragraph-count=\"2\"><figure name=\"47b5\" id=\"47b5\" class=\"graf graf--figure graf--layoutOutsetRow is-partialWidth graf-after--figure\" style=\"width: 50%;\"><img class=\"graf-image\" data-image-id=\"1*4B5k8l1NXaFdzAkSW1YEWg.png\" data-width=\"3024\" data-height=\"1890\" data-is-featured=\"true\" src=\"https://cdn-images-1.medium.com/max/600/1*4B5k8l1NXaFdzAkSW1YEWg.png\"></figure><figure name=\"74a7\" id=\"74a7\" class=\"graf graf--figure graf--layoutOutsetRowContinue is-partialWidth graf-after--figure\" style=\"width: 50%;\"><img class=\"graf-image\" data-image-id=\"1*uzmtZC1my7KwIOEz4iSxtQ.png\" data-width=\"3024\" data-height=\"1890\" src=\"https://cdn-images-1.medium.com/max/600/1*uzmtZC1my7KwIOEz4iSxtQ.png\"><figcaption class=\"imageCaption\" style=\"width: 200%; left: -100%;\">Taobao vs Amazon — desktop version</figcaption></figure></div><div class=\"section-inner sectionLayout--insetColumn\"><p name=\"947d\" id=\"947d\" class=\"graf graf--p graf-after--figure\">If you compare <strong class=\"markup--strong markup--p-strong\">Taobao</strong> and <strong class=\"markup--strong markup--p-strong\">Amazon</strong>, you’ll notice it immediately:</p><ul class=\"postList\"><li name=\"59b6\" id=\"59b6\" class=\"graf graf--li graf-after--p\">Taobao is dense, dynamic, animated, and full of micro-features.</li><li name=\"bda7\" id=\"bda7\" class=\"graf graf--li graf-after--li\">Amazon is minimal, structured, whitespace-driven.</li></ul><p name=\"7557\" id=\"7557\" class=\"graf graf--p graf-after--li\">Chinese users expect <strong class=\"markup--strong markup--p-strong\">speed, richness, and integration</strong>. They trust <em class=\"markup--em markup--p-em\">apps</em>, not <em class=\"markup--em markup--p-em\">websites.</em></p><p name=\"9ff3\" id=\"9ff3\" class=\"graf graf--p graf-after--p\">Design for this expectation:</p><ul class=\"postList\"><li name=\"8175\" id=\"8175\" class=\"graf graf--li graf-after--p\">Mobile-first interactions.</li><li name=\"3bf1\" id=\"3bf1\" class=\"graf graf--li graf-after--li\">QR-code-based workflows.</li><li name=\"de30\" id=\"de30\" class=\"graf graf--li graf-after--li\">Embedded mini-programs and in-app experiences.</li></ul><p name=\"e185\" id=\"e185\" class=\"graf graf--p graf-after--li graf--trailing\">Localization, in China’s case, means <strong class=\"markup--strong markup--p-strong\">adapting to user psychology</strong>, not just changing text strings.</p></div></div></section><section name=\"bd6c\" class=\"section section--body\"><div class=\"section-divider\"><hr class=\"section-divider\"></div><div class=\"section-content\"><div class=\"section-inner sectionLayout--insetColumn\"><h3 name=\"7411\" id=\"7411\" class=\"graf graf--h3 graf--leading\">4. Technical Challenges for Deploying in China</h3><p name=\"cda6\" id=\"cda6\" class=\"graf graf--p graf-after--h3\">Before you plan your rollout, understand the common blockers:</p><ul class=\"postList\"><li name=\"a706\" id=\"a706\" class=\"graf graf--li graf-after--p\"><strong class=\"markup--strong markup--li-strong\">Network latency:</strong> The Great Firewall slows down cross-border traffic.</li><li name=\"369d\" id=\"369d\" class=\"graf graf--li graf-after--li\"><strong class=\"markup--strong markup--li-strong\">Blocked dependencies:</strong> Google Fonts, YouTube, Firebase, Cloudflare APIs often fail.</li><li name=\"5b85\" id=\"5b85\" class=\"graf graf--li graf-after--li\"><strong class=\"markup--strong markup--li-strong\">Hosting restrictions:</strong> Without an <strong class=\"markup--strong markup--li-strong\">ICP license</strong>, you can’t legally host inside Mainland China.</li><li name=\"1481\" id=\"1481\" class=\"graf graf--li graf-after--li\"><strong class=\"markup--strong markup--li-strong\">App distribution:</strong> There’s no Google Play — expect fragmented Android marketplaces.</li><li name=\"5801\" id=\"5801\" class=\"graf graf--li graf-after--li\"><strong class=\"markup--strong markup--li-strong\">Analytics &amp; SDKs:</strong> Western tools often don’t work; local SDKs like <strong class=\"markup--strong markup--li-strong\">Umeng</strong> are used instead.</li></ul><p name=\"854e\" id=\"854e\" class=\"graf graf--p graf-after--li graf--trailing\">Your tech stack might need regional forks or toggles — not just a global clone.</p></div></div></section><section name=\"4f2f\" class=\"section section--body\"><div class=\"section-divider\"><hr class=\"section-divider\"></div><div class=\"section-content\"><div class=\"section-inner sectionLayout--insetColumn\"><h3 name=\"0e97\" id=\"0e97\" class=\"graf graf--h3 graf--leading\">5. Cloud Strategy: Deploying on Chinese Clouds</h3><p name=\"d0ef\" id=\"d0ef\" class=\"graf graf--p graf-after--h3\">To make your app fast and compliant, you need to deploy it closer to your users.<br>The three dominant cloud providers in China are:</p><ul class=\"postList\"><li name=\"ca5f\" id=\"ca5f\" class=\"graf graf--li graf-after--p\"><strong class=\"markup--strong markup--li-strong\">Alibaba Cloud (Aliyun)</strong> — broadest reach, developer-friendly APIs.</li><li name=\"64f8\" id=\"64f8\" class=\"graf graf--li graf-after--li\"><strong class=\"markup--strong markup--li-strong\">Tencent Cloud</strong> — strong gaming, streaming, and mini-program integration.</li><li name=\"4049\" id=\"4049\" class=\"graf graf--li graf-after--li\"><strong class=\"markup--strong markup--li-strong\">Huawei Cloud</strong> — enterprise and hybrid infrastructure focus.</li></ul><p name=\"6e39\" id=\"6e39\" class=\"graf graf--p graf-after--li\">Best practice:</p><ul class=\"postList\"><li name=\"961a\" id=\"961a\" class=\"graf graf--li graf-after--p\">Use <strong class=\"markup--strong markup--li-strong\">Mainland China regions</strong> for serving users inside the Great Firewall.</li><li name=\"0c94\" id=\"0c94\" class=\"graf graf--li graf-after--li\">Keep non-sensitive data or backups in <strong class=\"markup--strong markup--li-strong\">Hong Kong/Singapore</strong> regions for redundancy.</li><li name=\"6109\" id=\"6109\" class=\"graf graf--li graf-after--li graf--trailing\">Combine the two using <strong class=\"markup--strong markup--li-strong\">hybrid cloud deployment</strong> with region-aware routing.</li></ul></div></div></section><section name=\"9939\" class=\"section section--body\"><div class=\"section-divider\"><hr class=\"section-divider\"></div><div class=\"section-content\"><div class=\"section-inner sectionLayout--insetColumn\"><h3 name=\"2a3a\" id=\"2a3a\" class=\"graf graf--h3 graf--leading\">6. Compliance Essentials: ICP and MLPS</h3><p name=\"d36b\" id=\"d36b\" class=\"graf graf--p graf-after--h3\">You can’t deploy inside China without understanding compliance:</p><h3 name=\"5682\" id=\"5682\" class=\"graf graf--h3 graf-after--p\">ICP License (备案 / 许可证)</h3><ul class=\"postList\"><li name=\"005d\" id=\"005d\" class=\"graf graf--li graf-after--h3\">Required for any public-facing site hosted in Mainland China.</li><li name=\"1ac7\" id=\"1ac7\" class=\"graf graf--li graf-after--li\">Issued by the MIIT (Ministry of Industry and Information Technology).</li><li name=\"75e6\" id=\"75e6\" class=\"graf graf--li graf-after--li\">ICP Filing → informational sites.</li><li name=\"6f6d\" id=\"6f6d\" class=\"graf graf--li graf-after--li\">ICP Commercial License → apps generating revenue.</li></ul><h3 name=\"f976\" id=\"f976\" class=\"graf graf--h3 graf-after--li\">MLPS 2.0 — Multi-Level Protection Scheme</h3><ul class=\"postList\"><li name=\"576b\" id=\"576b\" class=\"graf graf--li graf-after--h3\">China’s cybersecurity compliance framework.</li><li name=\"e2e9\" id=\"e2e9\" class=\"graf graf--li graf-after--li\">Level 2 is typical for SaaS/web apps.</li><li name=\"4cc7\" id=\"4cc7\" class=\"graf graf--li graf-after--li\">Covers data protection, monitoring, incident response, encryption.</li></ul><p name=\"9c68\" id=\"9c68\" class=\"graf graf--p graf-after--li graf--trailing\">Compliance isn’t a blocker — it’s an <strong class=\"markup--strong markup--p-strong\">entry ticket</strong> to long-term stability.</p></div></div></section><section name=\"b886\" class=\"section section--body\"><div class=\"section-divider\"><hr class=\"section-divider\"></div><div class=\"section-content\"><div class=\"section-inner sectionLayout--insetColumn\"><h3 name=\"e8f7\" id=\"e8f7\" class=\"graf graf--h3 graf--leading\">7. Developer Playbook: Cloud-Native &amp; Firewall-Friendly</h3><p name=\"94d9\" id=\"94d9\" class=\"graf graf--p graf-after--h3\">Here’s how to build and deploy web apps that actually perform inside China:</p><ul class=\"postList\"><li name=\"9c6e\" id=\"9c6e\" class=\"graf graf--li graf-after--p\">🧱 <strong class=\"markup--strong markup--li-strong\">Cloud-native mindset</strong> — containerize everything.</li><li name=\"5934\" id=\"5934\" class=\"graf graf--li graf-after--li\">🐳 <strong class=\"markup--strong markup--li-strong\">Host your own Docker registry</strong> (Harbor or Alibaba Cloud ACR) since Docker Hub is slow or unreachable.</li><li name=\"8c5d\" id=\"8c5d\" class=\"graf graf--li graf-after--li\">☁️ <strong class=\"markup--strong markup--li-strong\">Use local CDNs</strong> — Alibaba Cloud CDN, Tencent Cloud CDN, or Baishan Cloud.</li><li name=\"728d\" id=\"728d\" class=\"graf graf--li graf-after--li\">🧭 <strong class=\"markup--strong markup--li-strong\">Hybrid routing</strong> — serve static assets inside CN, APIs from HK/SG for simplicity.</li><li name=\"43a3\" id=\"43a3\" class=\"graf graf--li graf-after--li\">🖋 <strong class=\"markup--strong markup--li-strong\">Self-host assets</strong> — fonts, scripts, analytics.</li><li name=\"3d59\" id=\"3d59\" class=\"graf graf--li graf-after--li\">📊 <strong class=\"markup--strong markup--li-strong\">Local analytics</strong> — Umeng, Sensors Data, or OpenTelemetry for cross-region metrics.</li><li name=\"e08c\" id=\"e08c\" class=\"graf graf--li graf-after--li\">🧪 <strong class=\"markup--strong markup--li-strong\">Simulate Mainland conditions</strong> — test with VPN throttling or China-based probes.</li></ul><p name=\"e627\" id=\"e627\" class=\"graf graf--p graf-after--li graf--trailing\">Think <em class=\"markup--em markup--p-em\">“multi-cloud + multi-region”</em>, not <em class=\"markup--em markup--p-em\">“one global region fits all.”</em></p></div></div></section><section name=\"bbae\" class=\"section section--body\"><div class=\"section-divider\"><hr class=\"section-divider\"></div><div class=\"section-content\"><div class=\"section-inner sectionLayout--insetColumn\"><h3 name=\"1d21\" id=\"1d21\" class=\"graf graf--h3 graf--leading\">8. The Developer Mindset Shift</h3><p name=\"cd16\" id=\"cd16\" class=\"graf graf--p graf-after--h3\">Most localization efforts stop at translation.<br>But real China-readiness requires a mindset shift:</p><ul class=\"postList\"><li name=\"d271\" id=\"d271\" class=\"graf graf--li graf-after--p\">From <strong class=\"markup--strong markup--li-strong\">monolithic</strong> → <strong class=\"markup--strong markup--li-strong\">modular</strong>.</li><li name=\"1911\" id=\"1911\" class=\"graf graf--li graf-after--li\">From <strong class=\"markup--strong markup--li-strong\">global CDN</strong> → <strong class=\"markup--strong markup--li-strong\">regional edge nodes.</strong></li><li name=\"e237\" id=\"e237\" class=\"graf graf--li graf-after--li\">From <strong class=\"markup--strong markup--li-strong\">foreign API dependence</strong> → <strong class=\"markup--strong markup--li-strong\">local integrations.</strong></li></ul><p name=\"2ce2\" id=\"2ce2\" class=\"graf graf--p graf-after--li graf--trailing\">Localization ≠ translation — <strong class=\"markup--strong markup--p-strong\">it’s architecture.</strong></p></div></div></section><section name=\"5dea\" class=\"section section--body\"><div class=\"section-divider\"><hr class=\"section-divider\"></div><div class=\"section-content\"><div class=\"section-inner sectionLayout--insetColumn\"><h3 name=\"cdab\" id=\"cdab\" class=\"graf graf--h3 graf--leading\">9. Watch the Full Talk on YouTube 🎥</h3><p name=\"333b\" id=\"333b\" class=\"graf graf--p graf-after--h3\">📺 Watch the full talk: <em class=\"markup--em markup--p-em\">“Make Your App China-Ready: Deploying Inside the Great Firewall”</em></p><figure name=\"daf7\" id=\"daf7\" class=\"graf graf--figure graf--iframe graf-after--p graf--trailing\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/lghrakauXEg?feature=oembed\" width=\"700\" height=\"393\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\"></iframe></figure></div></div></section><section name=\"d6ce\" class=\"section section--body\"><div class=\"section-divider\"><hr class=\"section-divider\"></div><div class=\"section-content\"><div class=\"section-inner sectionLayout--insetColumn\"><h3 name=\"2c30\" id=\"2c30\" class=\"graf graf--h3 graf--leading\">10. Key Takeaways</h3><p name=\"15b6\" id=\"15b6\" class=\"graf graf--p graf-after--h3 graf--trailing\">✅ The Great Firewall isn’t an obstacle — it’s an <em class=\"markup--em markup--p-em\">environment</em> you design for.<br>✅ Treat China as a <strong class=\"markup--strong markup--p-strong\">region</strong>, not an exception.<br>✅ Build <strong class=\"markup--strong markup--p-strong\">cloud-native</strong> systems for portability across providers.<br>✅ Replace global dependencies with <strong class=\"markup--strong markup--p-strong\">local equivalents</strong>.<br>✅ Compliance (ICP + MLPS) is part of your architecture.<br>✅ Test from <em class=\"markup--em markup--p-em\">inside China</em>, not outside it.</p></div></div></section><section name=\"adc6\" class=\"section section--body\"><div class=\"section-divider\"><hr class=\"section-divider\"></div><div class=\"section-content\"><div class=\"section-inner sectionLayout--insetColumn\"><h3 name=\"6c32\" id=\"6c32\" class=\"graf graf--h3 graf--leading\">11. Final Thoughts</h3><p name=\"93b4\" id=\"93b4\" class=\"graf graf--p graf-after--h3\">Deploying web services inside the <strong class=\"markup--strong markup--p-strong\">Great Chinese Firewall</strong> isn’t just about getting through filters — it’s about <strong class=\"markup--strong markup--p-strong\">understanding how the ecosystem works</strong> and designing accordingly.</p><p name=\"9f8a\" id=\"9f8a\" class=\"graf graf--p graf-after--p graf--trailing\">If you can make your app China-ready, you can make it <em class=\"markup--em markup--p-em\">anywhere-ready.</em></p></div></div></section><section name=\"64de\" class=\"section section--body\"><div class=\"section-divider\"><hr class=\"section-divider\"></div><div class=\"section-content\"><div class=\"section-inner sectionLayout--insetColumn\"><h3 name=\"e072\" id=\"e072\" class=\"graf graf--h3 graf--leading\">🧩 SEO Tags</h3><p name=\"1e9d\" id=\"1e9d\" class=\"graf graf--p graf-after--h3 graf--trailing\"><code class=\"markup--code markup--p-code\">Great Firewall</code>, <code class=\"markup--code markup--p-code\">deploy in China</code>, <code class=\"markup--code markup--p-code\">Chinese cloud</code>, <code class=\"markup--code markup--p-code\">Alibaba Cloud</code>, <code class=\"markup--code markup--p-code\">Tencent Cloud</code>, <code class=\"markup--code markup--p-code\">Huawei Cloud</code>, <code class=\"markup--code markup--p-code\">China web localization</code>, <code class=\"markup--code markup--p-code\">ICP license</code>, <code class=\"markup--code markup--p-code\">MLPS 2.0</code>, <code class=\"markup--code markup--p-code\">China-ready app</code></p></div></div></section><section name=\"a47d\" class=\"section section--body section--last\"><div class=\"section-divider\"><hr class=\"section-divider\"></div><div class=\"section-content\"><div class=\"section-inner sectionLayout--insetColumn\"><h3 name=\"c302\" id=\"c302\" class=\"graf graf--h3 graf--leading\">Open Graph / Social Share Image Text</h3><blockquote name=\"511b\" id=\"511b\" class=\"graf graf--blockquote graf--startsWithDoubleQuote graf-after--h3 graf--trailing\"><em class=\"markup--em markup--blockquote-em\">“Deploy Web Apps in China — Cloud-Native Strategies for the Great Firewall”</em></blockquote></div></div></section>\n</section>\n<footer><p>By <a href=\"https://medium.com/@ali_farooqi\" class=\"p-author h-card\">Ali Farooqi</a> on <a href=\"https://medium.com/p/5aab4e1b08bd\"><time class=\"dt-published\" datetime=\"2025-10-28T05:33:27.871Z\">October 28, 2025</time></a>.</p><p><a href=\"https://medium.com/@ali_farooqi/make-your-app-china-ready-how-to-deploy-web-services-inside-the-great-chinese-firewall-5aab4e1b08bd\" class=\"p-canonical\">Canonical link</a></p><p>Exported from <a href=\"https://medium.com\">Medium</a> on October 11, 2026.</p></footer></article></body></html>",
